# Asset rights, attribution, and testing-purpose notice

DualSense Studio is an independent, unofficial technical prototype for testing 3D rendering, material finishes, texture mapping, and interchangeable visual parts. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Sony Interactive Entertainment, PlayStation, or the owners of the featured game properties.

## No ownership claim over third-party designs

The project author claims no ownership of Sony/PlayStation controller industrial designs, product names, logos, trademarks, limited-edition artwork, official promotional photographs, or the characters and branding depicted in them. Those materials remain the property of their respective rights holders, including Sony Interactive Entertainment and the relevant game publishers and licensors.

Reference-based artwork recreations in this prototype are presented solely as visual experiments and approximations. They are not official production textures, authenticated scans, replacement-part specifications, or licensed merchandise. A testing-purpose notice does not grant permission to reuse third-party artwork or trademarks.

## Supplied 3D model

“Playstation 5 Dualsense” by **AHarmlessPotato**:

- Source: https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/playstation-5-dualsense-878c1f882808477ab81c2fe86d5a3936
- Creator: https://sketchfab.com/AHarmlessPotato
- License: **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International**, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- Modifications in this project: coordinate normalization, connected-surface grouping and splitting, conversion of supplied source geometry, additional UV attributes, and material/texture customization.

The model remains subject to its CC BY 4.0 attribution requirements. This notice does not replace or remove that license.

## Other project assets

Part-selector icons were generated for this project using an image-generation tool; they are not official Sony UI assets. Reference photograph URLs and uncertainty notes are recorded in the asset documentation. Source code and reconstructed graphic experiments do not transfer ownership of any underlying third-party design.

No blanket license to third-party assets is granted by this repository. Any reuse must respect the applicable original licenses and rights-holder permissions.
